00:39:41.200 --> 00:39:43.800
<i>We're heading for the West
Not heading for the East</i>


00:39:43.900 --> 00:39:48.900
<i>We're gonna live our dream
'Cause we're wild and free
-Κοίτα ένα φρικιό.</i>


